<title>USA: American Trans Air crewmembers okay pact.</title>
<headline>American Trans Air crewmembers okay pact.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Trans Air Inc, principal subsidiary of Amtran Inc, said Wednesday cockpit cremembers ratified a four-year contract, the first for the crewmwmbers.</p>
<p>An earlier tentative agreement was rejected by the pilots in January, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
